/* ================================================================
 * SPDX-FileCopyrightText:    2026 Filippo Quadri
 * SPDX-License-Identifier:   Apache-2.0 WITH SHL-2.1
 * Description:               PROVISIONAL Liberty for AION_maj3i_1
 *
 * Function: inverting 3-input majority:  O0 = !maj(I0, I1, I2)
 *
 * Area is the FLOORPLAN.md width, not a drawn cell -- 7 CoreSites x 1.8144 um2 =
 * 12.7008 um2 -- against a PDK baseline of sg13g2_or2_1 + sg13g2_a22oi_1, 11 sites.
 * FLOORPLAN.md: 5 columns on one unbroken diffusion strip per row,
 * Activ 2930 nm in a 3360 nm cell.
 * It is the number ABC chooses on, so it is the knob to sweep: the largest
 * site count at which the mapper still takes the cell is the layout budget.
 *
 * Every timing and power table is sg13g2_a22oi_1's unconditional arc,
 * copied verbatim with related_pin renamed (I0 <- A1 (cap x2), I1 <- A2 (cap x2), I2 <- B1).
 * Its conditional (`when`) arcs and state-dependent leakage are dropped,
 * because their conditions name the donor's pins.  cell_leakage_power is
 * the donor's scaled by device count (138.885 nW x 10/8).
 * Single stage like the donor, but I0/I1 load doubles its input cap.
 *
 * It is NOT a characterization.  scripts/pdk_cell.py's post-layout stage
 * writes the .lib that replaces it; never sign anything off against this.
 * ================================================================ */
